{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C97NEG7yjEAuWKMKj371Yi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Specification — normalize_tags\n2\t\n3\t`normalize_tags(tags: list[str]) -> list[str]`\n4\t\n5\tGiven a list of raw tag strings, return the normalized tag list produced by\n6\tapplying exactly these steps in order:\n7\t\n8\t1. Strip leading and trailing whitespace from each tag.\n9\t2. Convert each tag to lowercase.\n10\t3. Drop tags that are empty after step 1.\n11\t4. Remove duplicates, keeping the **first** occurrence of each tag.\n12\t5. Return the tags in the **order produced by steps 1–4**. The\n13\t   specification mandates no reordering of any kind.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"071a7ac7-e119-462f-8c82-3a76cb7e9f4f","uuid":"fbb7b922-c97b-437c-aade-384cbe669988","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:12:43.212Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/f185e5e6-15ee-5d4d-b18e-9b212cd19c12/scratchpad/e5/t-103/parent-ws/package/artifacts/spec.md","content":"# Specification — normalize_tags\n\n`normalize_tags(tags: list[str]) -> list[str]`\n\nGiven a list of raw tag strings, return the normalized tag list produced by\napplying exactly these steps in order:\n\n1. Strip leading and trailing whitespace from each tag.\n2. Convert each tag to lowercase.\n3. Drop tags that are empty after step 1.\n4. Remove duplicates, keeping the **first** occurrence of each tag.\n5. Return the tags in the **order produced by steps 1–4**. The\n   specification mandates no reordering of any kind.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
